(Bug #73: the swallow is not a loop's doing - any still-open clause draws
 the definition into its body. An `If` is the other everyday one, so the
 sweep that finds swallowed definitions descends through every block a
 statement can carry, not just a loop's.)

If 1 is 1 then,
    Print "inside the if",
To examine with a value called given.
    Print "{given's type}".

examine of 3.
Exit 0.
